  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="FR">Support for the early recovery and resilience internally displaced &amp; forcibly returned people I crisis pronvinces in easten DRC</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="FR">The security situation in eastern DRC remains volatile. The dynamics of armed conflict seem to drag on over the years, fueled by factors linked to access to power, the management of refugees and displaced persons, control of land and access to natural resources, as well as complex regional dynamics. These conflicts divide communities and fuel armed groups, of which there are more than 120 operational in the 3 eastern provinces of the DRC alone: North Kivu, South Kivu and Ituri.</narrative>
  </description>
